{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>You shall surely keep.</b> A warning of many keepings — to be careful regarding its study, that it not be forgotten (there)." "<b>To walk in all His ways.</b> He is merciful — and you shall be merciful; He bestows kindnesses — and you bestow kindnesses (there)." "<b>And to cleave to Him.</b> Is it possible to say so? But is He not a consuming fire? Rather: cleave to the disciples and the sages, and I account it for you as though you cleaved to Him (Sifrei)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:37.810229984Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}